{"v":4,"catch":"你從未像這樣打過保齡球。","desc":"保齡球不僅可以在大廳裡玩，也不一定只能在直線球道上進行。誰說遊戲中不能使用炸彈或彈簧呢？\n\n你還可以擊倒瓶子，這樣會更加有趣。了解這款遊戲與經典保齡球有何不同。解鎖新關卡，你會驚訝地發現並非所有事情都像看起來那麼簡單。\n\n來看看NOSTRA.GAMES團隊的新趣味遊戲吧。\n\n每個關卡都有一個解決方案——試著一次擊中它！","publisher":"NOSTRA GAMES","release":"2025-11-27","genres":["街機","模擬","益智","策略"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.3GB / Switch 0.3GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/125f893bdffbfe25e0a28996992926e7e1802872157b237df355acc5166bdcd8.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/893c9fde7b8ad7baa88f7adab543df446867d21d24653c45d12d4d16f3e06deb.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/740dafc3ade75c942b857d0b0b5369e6f36d917c21b46041eb3d0c2e577dab04.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e23b92c4ca474efa6084e8a410a31fbc92e682b7694ee85d512893639fa220b0.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1da0d1b79331a381721cab6043c571582ec7b1900530912f54464ad0026f0fc2.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/61913632e6051c7c65e8bb0936435f73aea2f7c57a19046ad8785320667e9b45.jpg"],"titleId":"010005c025548000","dlc":[]}